>
  <h2>A great bathroom is quiet, clean, and built to last.</h2>
  <p>
    The best bathrooms don’t shout. They’re the ones that feel calm at the end of a long day, that
    are easy to keep clean, and that still look right many years later. Getting there is less about
    picking the prettiest tile and more about what happens behind it.
  </p>
  <p>
    At Reliable Builders, tile and waterproofing are things we do ourselves — not hand off to the
    lowest bidder. That’s exactly why our bathrooms hold up.
  </p>
  <h3>The part nobody shows you on Instagram</h3>
  <p>
    A bathroom is the wettest room in your house, and water is patient. If the slope of the shower
    pan is off, or the waterproof membrane is skipped to save a day, the tile can look flawless and
    still be failing behind the scenes. By the time you see it, the damage is done.
  </p>
  <p>
    We’d rather spend the extra time on the layers you’ll never see. Proper pans, proper membranes,
    proper ventilation. It’s not glamorous, but it’s the difference between a bathroom you love and
    a bathroom you’re redoing in five years.
  </p>
  <h3>Designed around real life</h3>
  <p>
    Whether it’s a primary bath you want to feel like a retreat or a guest bath you want to modernize
    on a smart budget, we’ll help you make choices that fit both your taste and your number. And if
    you’re thinking long term, we can build in curbless entries, grab bars, and comfort-height
    fixtures so the space works for you at every stage.
  </p>
